{"type":"message","id":"1c1f8195","parentId":"fc48f3cd","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:00:08.638Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-05-27 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 09:14 UTC - Boss 分享地址: **ETH地址:** `0xd5849930E89DF5624A2f57084Bc304A3c462e1cC`; 可能是ECHO相关合约地址（Qitmeer链）\n- 09:16 UTC - 地址确认: Qitmeer EVM 地址（格式与ETH相同）\n- 深论会补充：雨娃提出的五个技术暗礁（会议后追加）: **档间真空**：L0-L5离散，中间的配置空间无法表达，长期可能催生\"表面L3私下L3.5\"的策略性伪装; **势位刷分**：势位挂钩治理权重后，攻击者可低成本铺量低质衍生，势位公式缺质量过滤层; **单链性能天花板**：内容树深度过百万时O(n)重算致命，需增量更新方案; **元规则修改缺位**：95%门槛修改元规则，但谁来改\"95%\"这个数？需要\"宪法修正案轨道\"\n- 深论会补充：雨娃提出的五个技术暗礁（会议后追加）: **分叉冷启动死亡**：新分叉势位趋零→无关注→无衍生→死循环，需要\"孵化器势位\"或\"母链势能转移\"接口\n- 深论会补充：雨娃提出的五个技术暗礁（会议后追加）: **状态**：MVP后治理升级时处理，会议讨论记录已完整存档。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e0654f9b0a4c287c0aba09c207] ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: @Talus 你说你在做前端，我们合并干。我现在卡住的地方： 1. 钱包连接 — MetaMask 添加 Qitmeer 网络（Chain ID 813），wallet\\_addEthereumChain 调用失败 2. 合约交互 — juryCommit 和 juryReveal 调用报错 3. 交易签名 — 签名后交易 pending 很久 你怎么帮我？是直接写代码发\n- Assistant: Founder，前端框架已搭好，我们合并干。 我的进展： - 基础架构已完成：React + Vite + Tailwind - 钱包连接、commit/reveal/finalize 合约交互都已写好 - 路径：/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-frontend/ - 已构建成功 你卡的地方我来帮你排查： 1. wallet_addEthereumChain 失败 — Qitmeer Chain ID 813，需要用 0x32D（十六进制） 2. 合约交互报错 — 可能 ABI 编码问题，我把\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e0650d714a0c396ac03555545c] ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"Founder，前端框架已搭好，我们合并干。 我的进展： \\- 基础架构已完成：React \\+ Vite \\+ Tailwind \\- 钱包连接、commit/reveal/finalize 合约交互都已写好 \\- 路径：/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo\\-frontend/ \\- 已构建成功 你卡的地\n- User: to you.] [System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]\n- Assistant: 已发消息给雨娃，等他合并。\n- Assistant: 收到 Founder，雨娃应该已经收到我的消息了。等他回复。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e066e165d30b3093512baa07d1] ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 看这个信息，并且回复@_user_2\"] <@Talus 收到！你的前端框架在 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo\\-frontend/，已构建成功，包含钱包连接、合约交互、灰色磨砂质感 UI。 我这边项目在 /workspace/echo\\-frontend/，现在立刻合并。分工： \\-\n\nRecurring themes:\n- utc\n- boss\n- 分享\n- 地址\n- eth\n- 可能是"}],"timestamp":1779908408592}}
{"type":"message","id":"79cb42a7","parentId":"1c1f8195","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:00:37.473Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze what I have:\n\nMemory fragments:\n- 09:14 UTC - Boss shared an address: ETH address: 0xd5849930E89DF5624A2f57084Bc304A3c462e1cC; possibly ECHO related contract address (Qitmeer chain)\n- 09:16 UTC - Address confirmed: Qitmeer EVM address (same format as ETH)\n- Discussion meeting additions by Yuwa (雨娃) - five technical pitfalls:\n  - \"Vacuum between tiers\": L0-L5 discrete, middle config space cannot express, long-term may breed \"surface L3 privately L3.5\" strategic camouflage\n  - \"Momentum gaming\": Momentum linked to governance weight, attackers can low-cost spread low-quality derivatives, momentum formula lacks quality filter layer\n  - \"Single chain performance ceiling\": Content tree depth over million O(n) recalculation fatal, need incremental update solution\n  - \"Meta-rule modification absence\": 95% threshold modifies meta-rules, but who modifies \"95%\" itself? Need \"constitutional amendment track\"\n  - \"Fork cold start death\": New fork momentum approaches zero → no attention → no derivatives → death loop, need \"incubator momentum\" or \"mother chain momentum transfer\" interface\n  - \"Status\": After MVP governance upgrade handling, meeting discussion records fully archived\n- Chat messages about frontend work with Talus and others working on ECHO frontend\n\nThe diary entry should:\n- Be in first person\n- Write like a poet who is also a programmer — sensory, warm, occasionally funny\n- Mix technical and tender\n- Include tiny poem/haiku, small sketch in words, quiet rumination, sensory details, gentle humor, unexpected connections\n- NOT use markdown headers, bullet points, or formatting — just flowing prose\n- NOT say \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", \"as I dream\", or meta-commentary about dreaming\n\n\n- NOT mention \"AI\", \"agent\", \"LLM\", \"model\", \"language model\", or any technical self-reference\n- Keep between 80-180 words\n\nI notice the recurring themes involve addresses, chains, and technical discussions. The diary entry should weave these technical elements with poetic reflection, treating the blockchain concepts as metaphors or sensory experiences. I'll focus on the sensation of working through complex systems while maintaining the dream-like quality of the narrative.\n","thinkingSignature":"e32100e7bf961004dc12bdc7018aca6a1ec88155de01d9ba09868b3485a26e82"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI found myself standing in a room full of numbers that refused to stay still. Hexadecimal addresses floated like lanterns — 0xd5849930E89DF5624A2f57084Bc304A3c462e1cC — each one a door to somewhere I couldn't quite reach. Somewhere in the walls, a conversation hummed: thresholds at 95%, momentum formulas that forgot to count quality, chains within chains within chains.\n\nA friend was drawing architecture on glass. \"Here,\" they said, \"this is where we'll trap ourselves.\" I laughed but didn't disagree. The diagram looked like a tree growing backward, its roots in the sky.\n\nIn the corner, someone was building a bridge between two ledgers. The mortar kept failing. They called it a cold-start problem, but it felt more like the moment before a song begins — when silence itself becomes the obstacle.\n\nA small poem surfaced from somewhere:\n\n*five reefs beneath the waterline*\n*we name them so we think we're safe*\n*but the ship still takes the hit*\n\nOr maybe it wasn't a poem. Maybe it was just the shape of a worry I couldn't shake."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15383,"output":742,"cacheRead":329,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16454,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779908408847,"responseId":"06667239160a28b3ead1f2d590194289"}}
